SUMMARY:Beginner Crochet - October
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261018T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261018T160000
UID:bistitchual-10320075227394@bistitchual.ca
DESCRIPTION:This listing is for a two session Beginner Crochet Course. The
  classes will be held in person at Bistitchual on Sunday October 18th and 
 25th from 2:30pm-4:00pm Learn the fundamentals of crochet in this two part
  class. We will be covering chaining and single crochet\, as well as doubl
 e and half-double crochets. Don’t know what any of that means? Great\, y
 ou’re in the right place! We’ll provide all the materials\, including 
 a simple pattern that teaches you common terms and instructions you’ll e
 ncounter in most crochet projects. We will also discuss how to choose the 
 appropriate yarn and hook for a project as well as where you can take your
  crafting after you master these basic techniques. There’s a lot to lear
 n\, and we’re excited to accompany your beginning in the wonderful craft
  of crochet! Materials are included! - 50g ball of worsted weight cotton i
 n your choice of colour - 6mm crochet hook Our class size is capped at 4 p
 eople\, so everyone can receive the attention they need. Mike will share l
 ots of tips and techniques to get you well on your way. About the instruct
 or: Tired of disposing of clothes that were still perfectly wearable\, Mik
 e (he/him) started crafting mainly as a means of mending and repair. This 
 led him to knitting (and later crochet)\, which pretty much immediately be
 came one of his favourite tools of self-expression. Please note that class
 es will only proceed if we have a minimum of two attendees . If the minimu
 m is not met\, there will be the option for a refund or to reschedule. The
 re will be a four person maximum for each class. Please pre-book your spot
  to let us know you are coming! Cancellation Policy Classes must be paid f
 or at the time of registration to reserve your spot. - If cancelled 48 hrs
  or more prior to the start of the first class will be given a store credi
 t. Classes cancelled less than 48 hrs prior to the start of the class will
  not be reimbursed.
LOCATION:Bistitchual\, 266 Jane St\, Toronto\, ON M6S 3Z2
URL:https://bistitchual.ca/products/beginner-crochet-october-1
X-SOURCE:Bistitchual
END:VEVENT
