BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Learn to Spin Your Own Yarn- September
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T163000
UID:bistitchual-9622755082498@bistitchual.ca
DESCRIPTION:This listing is for a three session Beginner Spinning Course. 
 The classes will be held in person at Bistitchual on Saturday September 26
 \, October 3\, and October 10 from 3:00pm-4:30pm Learn how to transform fi
 bre into yarn with our drop spindle class! In this class you will learn ho
 w to use a drop spindle to spin starting with woolly fibre and ending with
  a completed\, ready to use yarn. You will learn how to spin a single ply 
 yarn\, how to spin a 2-ply yarn using the Andean Plying method\, and how t
 o chain ply for a 3-ply yarn over three classes. We will discuss spinning 
 basics as well as different types of yarn\, fibres\, processing tools\, an
 d preparations and how these affect the finished yarn. Drop spindles must 
 be brought by students or purchased in store. 50g of fibre provided in two
  different colours. Please note that classes will only proceed if we have 
 a minimum of two attendees . If the minimum is not met\, there will be the
  option for a refund or to reschedule. There will be a four person maximum
  for each class. Please pre-book your spot to let us know you are coming! 
 Cancellation Policy Classes must be paid for at the time of registration t
 o reserve your spot. - If cancelled 48 hrs or more prior to the start of t
 he first class will be given a store credit. Classes cancelled less than 4
 8 hrs prior to the start of the class will not be reimbursed.
LOCATION:Bistitchual\, 266 Jane St\, Toronto\, ON M6S 3Z2
URL:https://bistitchual.ca/products/learn-to-spn-september
X-SOURCE:Bistitchual
END:VEVENT
